    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "设点$O$在点$A$和$B$之间，$x_A<0$（图23，a）．\n于是，$x_B>0$．\n在这种情况下，",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "设点$O$在点$A$和$B$之间，$x_A<0$（图23，а）.于是，$x_B>0$.在这种情况下，",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "$|AB|=|AO|+|OB|=-x_A+x_B=x_B-x_A=|x_B-x_A|$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "$|AB|=|AO|+|OB|=-x_A+x_B=x_B-x_A=|x_B-x_A|$.",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "如果$x_A>0$，那么$x_B<0$（图23，b），而且",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 22,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0032#4"
      ],
      "source_text": "如果$x_A>0$，那么$x_B<0$（图23，б），而且",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
